{"data":{"body":"[P2] Keep optional header capture fail-open for malformed wrapper diagnostics. `getCause()` is called twice and outside a guard, so a custom completion/future wrapper whose accessor throws an ordinary exception escapes `capture()` and fails the invocation instead of returning authoritative absence. Read each cause once inside `try`/`catch`, rethrow only `VirtualMachineError`/`ThreadDeath`, and stop traversal on other accessor failures. Add an unreadable-cause test.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc76jWz0","finding_digest":"ef51bb860b4b5f4163a2896de102928fef9f6a641a7daaf12951618023556a32","finding_id":"arf_v1_55i3xbqljnpucy5crfw6causr7","finding_key":"sdk/execution/runtime-trace-header::rethrow-fatal::unreadable-cause-escapes-capture","identity_key":"sdk/execution/runtime-trace-header::rethrow-fatal::unreadable-cause-escapes-capture","line":65,"observation_digest":"d83be960ae3aec9056e4c439e919a485a397d33e8c4b2bf662a41b5c5c235b48","observation_id":"aro_v1_3a56syfohlwjavxeyq46sgneqw","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/execution/RuntimeTraceHeader.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-07T05:56:05Z","review_id":"arr_v1_rqwbz3xu3pzf5jpbjbwqa7a7fx","reviewed_base_sha":"f4e4e1db81c6fb0fbbaf25815d73757abf3fda7c","reviewed_head_sha":"58e3740634189a90aa161e2e96ed5436aefe9fcc","reviewer":"codex","start_line":64,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":782},"record_id":"art_v1_hl6urkgcvffb2zczzd7gvr2zel","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-07T05:56:05Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
